+    """Diagnostic per-layer workspace pool for the FlashInfer XQA decode path.
+
+    Default (``pool_size == 1``) is a strict pass-through to the legacy global
+    workspace buffer: the exact same tensor is handed to the kernel, so
+    behavior and allocation count are byte-for-byte identical to the current
+    single-buffer implementation.
