+        """Lazily allocate (on CUDA) and return the buffer for ``slot``.
+
+        Slot 0 reuses the legacy global workspace buffer
+        (``_get_trtllm_workspace_buffer()``) so the default pool size of 1
+        never creates an extra buffer. Slots 1..N-1 are independent,
+        lazily allocated ``torch.zeros`` buffers.
